OL,3,GNEWSANew GP and wellbeing hub 'a major
OL,4,Amilestone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cluster of empty and underb@Qused
OL,7,Fbuildings in East Sussex has been
OL,8,Ftransformed into a #21m modern health
OL,9,Fhub.
OL,11,FWellbeing Square in Newhaven, which
OL,12,Fbrings together primary care, community
OL,13,Fwellbeing and leisure services in one
OL,14,Flocation, officially opened on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FThe project was led by Lewes District
OL,18,FCouncil, which said it would "deliver a
OL,19,Fhighb@Qquality, modern healthcare
OL,20,Fenvironment that residents so richly
OL,21,Fdeserve".
